{"type":"message-part","messageId":"e397bf59-e6a5-4316-937e-7907d86cb044","role":"user","index":0,"part":{"type":"text","text":"# Filter Tools by App with Composio CLI\n\n## Background\n\nComposio provides a CLI to explore available tools. In this task, you will use the CLI to list tools filtered by their application.\n\n## Requirements\n\n* Use the Composio CLI to list all available tools for the `github` application.\n* Save the output to `/home/user/github_tools.log`.\n* Use the Composio CLI to list all available tools for the `slack` application.\n* Save the output to `/home/user/slack_tools.log`.\n* Ensure each log file contains only tools relevant to that specific application.\n\n## Implementation Guide\n\n1. Use `composio tools list --app github` (or similar filtering flags).\n2. Redirect the output to the specified log files.\n3. Check the CLI help `composio tools list --help` to find the correct filtering flag.\n\n## Constraints\n\n* Project path: /home/user\n* Log files: /home/user/github\\_tools.log, /home/user/slack\\_tools.log\n* Use the `composio` CLI.\n\n## Integrations\n\n* Composio"}}
{"type":"message-part","messageId":"e397bf59-e6a5-4316-937e-7907d86cb044","role":"user","index":0,"part":{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder># System Information\n\nOperating System: linux\nDefault Shell: \nHome Directory: /root\nCurrent Working Directory: /\nCurrent Time: Fri Apr 17 2026 04:28:16 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\n\n# GIT STATUS\nCurrent branch: \nMain branch (you will usually use this for PRs): \n\nRecent commits:\n\n\n# TODOs\nNo TODOs yet, if you are working on tasks that would benefit from a todo list please use the todoWrite tool to create one.</system-reminder>"}}
{"type":"message-part","messageId":"e397bf59-e6a5-4316-937e-7907d86cb044","role":"user","index":1,"part":{"type":"text","text":"# Filter Tools by App with Composio CLI\n\n## Background\n\nComposio provides a CLI to explore available tools. In this task, you will use the CLI to list tools filtered by their application.\n\n## Requirements\n\n* Use the Composio CLI to list all available tools for the `github` application.\n* Save the output to `/home/user/github_tools.log`.\n* Use the Composio CLI to list all available tools for the `slack` application.\n* Save the output to `/home/user/slack_tools.log`.\n* Ensure each log file contains only tools relevant to that specific application.\n\n## Implementation Guide\n\n1. Use `composio tools list --app github` (or similar filtering flags).\n2. Redirect the output to the specified log files.\n3. Check the CLI help `composio tools list --help` to find the correct filtering flag.\n\n## Constraints\n\n* Project path: /home/user\n* Log files: /home/user/github\\_tools.log, /home/user/slack\\_tools.log\n* Use the `composio` CLI.\n\n## Integrations\n\n* Composio"}}
